            "about": "****CD IS SOLD OUT!!!*****\nAlan Bloor has been grinding out a fearsome racket since 1994 with classic early releases on Alien8, RRR and Self Abuse among many others. A welder by trade, Bloor produces his sounds from a variety of homemade stainless steel instruments, car springs, saw blades and other scrap metal. Here we find Knurl in long-tone drone territory. One raw, unrelenting track of white hot grinding bowed metal sound.\n--RURAL ISOLATION PROJECT",
